      "content": "AWS Service Catalog enables organizations to create and manage catalogs of IT services that are approved for use on AWS. IT administrators can create and manage portfolios of products and control which users have access to which products for compliant, self-service provisioning.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Amazon Web Services",
